{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06977","headline":"咏帘 · 万楚","name":"咏帘","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玳瑁昔称华，玲珑薄绦纱。\n钩衔门势曲，节乱水纹斜。\n日弄长飞鸟，风摇不卷花。\n自当分内外，非是爲骄奢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"万楚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06977.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06977","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}